(2) The persons required by subsection (1) to notify any reportable matter are as follows:
(a)where the reportable matter is a reportable safety incident involving an exterior feature of a building —
(i)a person responsible for the exterior feature who is aware of the reportable safety incident;
(ii)a person who is authorised to carry out any retrofitting of that exterior feature for the purposes of Part 3 and who becomes aware of the reportable safety incident while performing the retrofitting;
[Act 15 of 2026 wef 01/07/2026]
(iii)a builder or supervisor (including a consultant) of building works related to the building who becomes aware of the reportable safety incident while carrying out or supervising the building works; or
